      "comment": "DISPERSION (1) was in the money on debut two runs ago then was about the mark again last time over 2180m at Terang, finishing 7 metres from the winner in second. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Meets a similar line up and he can figure in the finish. MYDEEPESTDESIRE (7) opened her career in pleasing fashion a month ago, finishing second and beaten a nose over 1710m at Ballarat. Tackles a similar assignment and she can go right on with the job. LAMBRO LOUELLA (3) must be considered after she finished runner-up when resuming over 1800m at Globe Derby Park nine days ago. EVIE KATE (5) was beaten 4 metres on debut last start over 1609m at Charlton. Has plenty of scope for improvement.",
